    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the capital city, a content creator was arrested after Seoul police secured an arrest warrant. The creator had used AI-generated content and digital manipulation to fabricate evidence, allegedly spreading misinformation for financial gain. This law enforcement action followed the claims against a public figure, leading to significant professional impact and reputational damage for the celebrity involved.",
