      "fit": 0.65
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A government body moved to enforce the law after an online personality made claims against a celebrity. The method involved fabrication of evidence through manipulated chat screenshots, an alleged illegal activity. The ensuing legal procedure led to the silencing of a critic and establishment fallout, disrupting the celebrity's facade and causing reputational damage.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
