      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.72
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The arrest of an individual in Seoul represents a consequence of crime stemming from an alleged deceptive practice. The individual leveraged digital tools, including AI-generated audio, to challenge power by accusing a protected celebrity. This act, framed as exposing corruption, resulted in the state's crackdown and the celebrity's career impact, halting public appearances since early 2025.",
